# Releases

This documentation is part of the generated application and travels with its release package. Read the
application manifest, dependency locks, API contract and generated SDK from the same package; a newer
development checkout does not replace the documentation for an installed older version.

Create application releases from immutable application commits. Regenerate the API/SDK artifacts, legal
metadata and dependency inventory for each release. A candidate build, CI artifact or local package cache
does not become a public release channel by itself.
